        <mxCell id="evidence" value="Scope: requested Windows LAN setup; inventory.md REG-02/03 and deployment section. All runtime state is UNVERIFIED.&#xa;Verification explicitly uses the database queue; decision mail queues after commit using configured queue behavior.&#xa;SQLite, SMTP, worker availability, HTTP/TLS configuration and USB input are deployment assumptions, not observed runtime facts.&#xa;RLCP palette: crimson heading; charcoal components; cream/gold infrastructure. Arrows describe the labeled connection purpose." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9EF;strokeColor=#D4A039;fontColor=#252525;fontSize=17;spacing=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
